*> More words that are keywords only where they appear: STOP RUN WITH
*> NORMAL STATUS, EXHIBIT NAMED, the bit operators and EQUALS of
*> GnuCOBOL, FORMATTED-DATETIME's SYSTEM-OFFSET, and the file control
*> block GnuCOBOL keeps per file (FH--FCD OF file).
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. MOREWORDS.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT DATA-FILE ASSIGN TO "DATA".
DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD  DATA-FILE.
01  DATA-REC            PIC X(80).
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  X1                  PIC 9(4) COMP-5.
01  STAMP               PIC X(30).
01  FCD-POINTER         USAGE POINTER.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    COMPUTE X1 = (X1 B-SHIFT-L 2) B-AND 255
    IF X1 EQUALS 4
        EXHIBIT NAMED X1
    END-IF
    MOVE FUNCTION FORMATTED-DATETIME
        ("YYYYDDDThhmmss+hhmm", 1, 45296, SYSTEM-OFFSET) TO STAMP
    SET FCD-POINTER TO ADDRESS OF FH--FCD OF DATA-FILE
    STOP RUN WITH NORMAL STATUS.
